
     Ctrl A a to detact!
     Ctrl A Alt S   save sessions (go-tmux-saver; autosaves every 10 min)
     Ctrl A Alt R   restore sessions (go-tmux-saver, merge)
     Ctrl A Alt Shift S / R   resurrect save / restore (manual fallback)
     Ctrl A I       install plugins (tpm)
     Ctrl A U       update plugins (tpm)


